      "sourceTextSha256": "396cd56d53d1710454cf1bb6a4060fdc0c0eae38e78d9b970e391cce3ece430c",
      "text": "After breakfast at the hotel, we will go on an excursion to the Tierra del Fuego National Park. This National Park is the southernmost nature reserve in the world, being the only National Park that has a 6 km long sea coastline along the Beagle Channel and an area of ​​63,000 hectares. During the tour, we will pass the Pipo River, the Susana Mountains, Ensenada Bay, see Redonda Island, Roca Lake, Lapataya Bay, lagoons, beaver dam and forest house. Landscapes of the park delight with diversity - rocky mountains, picturesque rivers, valleys and lakes. ",
